{"video":"ztRgOQlSs5Q","lines":[{"t":[1,3.2],"en":"Pheebs, you, uh, you got a second?"},{"t":[3.2,4.2],"en":"Sure."},{"t":[4.2,5.1],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[5.1,8.4],"en":"Ever since you, uh, told me that story about that bike,"},{"t":[8.4,10.4],"en":"I couldn't stop thinking about it."},{"t":[10.4,12.9],"en":"I mean, everyone should have a first bike, you know?"},{"t":[12.9,13.9],"en":"So..."},{"t":[16.6,18.1],"en":"Oh!"},{"t":[18.1,21.1],"en":"Oh, my God, Wallace!"},{"t":[21.1,21.8],"en":"You like it?"},{"t":[21.8,23.2],"en":"I love it!"},{"t":[23.2,23.9],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[23.9,24.9],"en":"Oh!"},{"t":[24.9,26.9],"en":"Oh, and I love you!"},{"t":[26.9,28.1],"en":"Oh."},{"t":[28.1,30.1],"en":"Not that way."},{"t":[30.1,31.7],"en":"The bike got you a lot closer."},{"t":[31.7,33.1],"en":"Oh."},{"t":[33.1,35.1],"en":"Well, uh, take it downstairs, you know?"},{"t":[35.1,37.1],"en":"Give it a test drive."},{"t":[37.1,38.1],"en":"Okay."},{"t":[38.1,39.7],"en":"Oh, my God!"},{"t":[39.7,42],"en":"My first bike!"},{"t":[42,45.5],"en":"Thank you for the best present I've ever gotten."},{"t":[45.5,47.2],"en":"You're welcome."},{"t":[49.3,51.2],"en":"Oh, and Chandler's about to cry."},{"t":[54,55.2],"en":"I'm not."},{"t":[58.1,61.7],"en":"Okay, now just remember everything I taught you, and you'll be fine."},{"t":[61.7,62.7],"en":"Okay?"},{"t":[62.7,63.7],"en":"Here we go."},{"t":[63.7,64.7],"en":"Ready?"},{"t":[64.7,65.7],"en":"Set."},{"t":[65.7,66.7],"en":"Wait."},{"t":[66.7,68.7],"en":"This seat is really uncomfortable."},{"t":[68.7,71.7],"en":"Okay, maybe before we start, we should just get another one."},{"t":[71.7,74.7],"en":"Perhaps like an airplane seat, or a beanbag chair."},{"t":[76.7,78.7],"en":"Phoebe, you can't get out of this, okay?"},{"t":[78.7,80.7],"en":"You have to learn how to ride a bike."},{"t":[80.7,81.7],"en":"Why?"},{"t":[81.7,83.3],"en":"Why do I have to learn?"},{"t":[83.3,87.3],"en":"Well, in case of an emergency."},{"t":[87.3,89.3],"en":"What kind of emergency?"},{"t":[89.3,95.3],"en":"Well, what if a man comes along, and puts a gun to your head, and says, \"You ride this"},{"t":[95.3,99.3],"en":"bike, or I'll shoot you.\""},{"t":[99.3,100.3],"en":"Okay."},{"t":[100.3,104.2],"en":"I would ring the bell to distract him, and then I would knock the gun out of his hand with"},{"t":[104.2,105.3],"en":"a Chinese throwing star."},{"t":[105.3,113.9],"en":"Okay, Phoebe, just get on the bike, and hey, I'll hold you up and push you."},{"t":[113.9,114.9],"en":"Okay?"},{"t":[114.9,116.9],"en":"You won't let go."},{"t":[116.9,117.9],"en":"No."},{"t":[117.9,118.9],"en":"You swear?"},{"t":[118.9,119.9],"en":"I swear."},{"t":[119.9,120.9],"en":"Okay."},{"t":[120.9,121.9],"en":"Come on."},{"t":[121.9,122.9],"en":"Okay."},{"t":[122.9,123],"en":"Come on."},{"t":[123,123.9],"en":"All right?"},{"t":[123.9,124.9],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[124.9,125.9],"en":"Here we go."},{"t":[125.9,126.9],"en":"All right?"},{"t":[126.9,127.9],"en":"All right."},{"t":[127.9,128.9],"en":"All right?"},{"t":[128.9,129.9],"en":"All right."},{"t":[129.9,130.9],"en":"Feel good?"},{"t":[130.9,131.9],"en":"Well."},{"t":[131.9,132.9],"en":"All right, try pedaling."},{"t":[132.9,133.9],"en":"That's it."},{"t":[133.9,134.9],"en":"You're doing great."},{"t":[134.9,135.9],"en":"You're doing great."},{"t":[135.9,136.9],"en":"Yes, yes, yes."},{"t":[136.9,137.9],"en":"Take control."},{"t":[137.9,138.9],"en":"Yes?"},{"t":[138.9,139.9],"en":"Whee!"},{"t":[139.9,140.9],"en":"Hey!"},{"t":[143.9,144.9],"en":"No!"},{"t":[144.9,145.9],"en":"You swore!"},{"t":[145.9,146.9],"en":"I just thought you were doing so well."},{"t":[146.9,147.9],"en":"I..."},{"t":[147.9,148.9],"en":"Shocked!"},{"t":[148.9,149.9],"en":"Shocked!"},{"t":[149.9,156.9],"en":"It's a legitimate learning technique."},{"t":[156.9,158.9],"en":"Wow."},{"t":[158.9,164.9],"en":"Oh, hello, liar."},{"t":[164.9,168.9],"en":"Look, I'm..."},{"t":[168.9,171.9],"en":"I'm really sorry I let go of the bike."},{"t":[171.9,174.9],"en":"I could have been killed, I hope you know."},{"t":[174.9,176.9],"en":"I know."},{"t":[176.9,177.9],"en":"I know."},{"t":[177.9,182.9],"en":"But can we please try it again, huh?"},{"t":[182.9,184.9],"en":"I mean, you were so close, Phoebe."},{"t":[184.9,186.9],"en":"Well, I would love to."},{"t":[186.9,187.9],"en":"But..."},{"t":[187.9,191.9],"en":"The bike got stolen and the police have no suspects."},{"t":[197.9,198.9],"en":"Phoebe."},{"t":[198.9,199.9],"en":"What?"},{"t":[199.9,200.9],"en":"What?"},{"t":[200.9,201.9],"en":"What the hell?"},{"t":[201.9,205.9],"en":"All right, you know what?"},{"t":[205.9,209.9],"en":"If you are not going to learn how to ride this bike, then I'm sorry."},{"t":[209.9,210.9],"en":"I'm just gonna have to take it back."},{"t":[210.9,211.9],"en":"What?"},{"t":[211.9,212.9],"en":"Why?"},{"t":[212.9,213.9],"en":"Because."},{"t":[213.9,214.9],"en":"Because."},{"t":[214.9,215.9],"en":"It's..."},{"t":[215.9,221.9],"en":"It would be like you having this guitar and never playing it."},{"t":[221.9,222.9],"en":"Okay?"},{"t":[222.9,224.9],"en":"This guitar wants to be played."},{"t":[224.9,228.9],"en":"And this bike wants to be ridden."},{"t":[228.9,234.9],"en":"And if you don't ride it, you're killing its spirit."},{"t":[234.9,237.9],"en":"The bike..."},{"t":[237.9,240.9],"en":"Is dying."},{"t":[244.9,245.9],"en":"All right."},{"t":[245.9,248.9],"en":"If you care enough to make up that load of crap, okay."},{"t":[249.9,250.9],"en":"Great, great."},{"t":[253.9,255.9],"en":"You're making the bike very happy."},{"t":[255.9,256.9],"en":"Okay, Ross."},{"t":[259.9,260.9],"en":"Please don't die."},{"t":[264.9,270.9],"en":"I can't believe it. I did it. I rode a bike."},{"t":[270.9,273.9],"en":"I never thought I'd be able to do that."},{"t":[273.9,274.9],"en":"Thank you, Ross."},{"t":[274.9,276.9],"en":"Oh, hey, don't thank me. Thank yourself."},{"t":[276.9,280.9],"en":"You're the one who faced your fears and ultimately overcame them."},{"t":[280.9,284.9],"en":"Don't be so corny, Ross. It's not an after-school special."},{"t":[284.9,285.9],"en":"Thank you, Ross."}]}
